<h3>System Compatibility Guarantee:</h3>
<p>
	Starpoint Software
	applications are guaranteed to be compatible with Windows operating systems
	as specified below when properly installed with all required libraries, and
	when running with proper permission settings.&nbsp; Overly restrictive
	permission settings can cause some software to fail or render some features
	unavailable.&nbsp; In the event of a software being incompatible with an
	operating system specified below as being compatible, Starpoint Software
	will repair the incompatibility within 30 days, or if unable to do, the
	customer is entitled to return the software for a full refund of the
	purchase price.&nbsp; In no event will Starpoint Software be liable for more
	than the purchase price of the software.
</p>



<h3>Windows 8/10/11 Incompatibility Warning</h3>

<p>
	When installing on Windows 8, you may get a message that the software is incompatible with this version of Windows.
	Ignore this message.
</p>



